      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Right, quick it is. How long has it felt blocked up?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:15",
      "end_timestamp": "00:21",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "About three weeks now. My husband says the telly is far too loud, and I've stopped hearing the kettle.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:23",
      "end_timestamp": "00:34",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Crept up. My hearing's worse every week, and I just can't be doing with it.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:48",
      "end_timestamp": "00:56",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Like I'm underwater, all full and muffled. Do you use cotton buds, is that what you're going to ask?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:08",
      "end_timestamp": "01:17",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Every morning, yes. I know, I know, everybody tells me off for it.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:25",
      "end_timestamp": "01:33",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thanks, nurse. While we have it, what are you taking at the moment?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:56",
